## Objective
Create the `mgrep context` CLI command that uses ContextFormatter to output search results as LLM context.

## Implementation Steps

### 1. Create command file
Create `src/commands/context.ts`:

```typescript
import { Command } from "commander";
import { createStore } from "@/lib/context";
import { loadConfig } from "@/lib/config";
import { ContextFormatter } from "@/lib/formatters";
import { syncFiles } from "./search"; // reuse sync logic

interface ContextOptions {
  format: "xml" | "markdown" | "plain";
  maxTokens?: number;
  maxResults: number;
  path?: string;
  clipboard: boolean;
  noSync: boolean;
}

export const context = new Command("context")
  .description("Export search results as LLM-optimized context")
  .argument("<query>", "Semantic search query")
  .option("-f, --format <format>", "Output format: xml, markdown, plain", "xml")
  .option("-t, --max-tokens <n>", "Maximum tokens in output", parseInt)
  .option("-n, --max-results <n>", "Maximum results to include", parseInt, 10)
  .option("-p, --path <path>", "Filter to specific path")
  .option("-c, --clipboard", "Copy to clipboard", false)
  .option("--no-sync", "Skip sync before search", false)
  .action(async (query: string, options: ContextOptions) => {
    // Implementation
  });
```

### 2. Command Flow
1. Load config and create store
2. Run sync if not --no-sync (reuse syncFiles from search.ts)
3. Execute semantic search with path filter
4. Format results using ContextFormatter
5. Output to stdout OR copy to clipboard
6. Show summary (files, tokens, truncation warning)

### 3. Error Handling
- No results: "No matching code found for query"
- Clipboard failure: Fall back to stdout with warning
- Token limit exceeded: Show truncation warning

### 4. Register Command
Update `src/index.ts` to register context command:
```typescript
import { context } from "./commands/context";
program.addCommand(context);
```

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] `mgrep context "query"` outputs XML context to stdout
- [ ] `--format markdown` outputs markdown format
- [ ] `--format plain` outputs plain text format
- [ ] `--max-tokens 2000` truncates output with warning
- [ ] `--path src/lib` filters to specific directory
- [ ] `--max-results 5` limits number of results
- [ ] Shows summary: "Exported 5 files (~2500 tokens)"
- [ ] Exit code 0 on success, 1 on error

