## Objective
Create a new `ContextFormatter` class that transforms search results into LLM-optimized context blocks.

## Implementation Steps

### 1. Create file structure
- Create `src/lib/formatters/context-formatter.ts`
- Create `src/lib/formatters/index.ts` for exports

### 2. Implement ContextFormatter class
```typescript
interface ContextFormatterOptions {
  format: "xml" | "markdown" | "plain";
  maxTokens?: number;
  includeMetadata?: boolean;
}

interface FormattedContext {
  content: string;
  tokenEstimate: number;
  fileCount: number;
  truncated: boolean;
}

class ContextFormatter {
  constructor(options: ContextFormatterOptions);
  format(results: SearchResult[]): FormattedContext;
  private formatXml(results: SearchResult[]): string;
  private formatMarkdown(results: SearchResult[]): string;
  private formatPlain(results: SearchResult[]): string;
  private estimateTokens(text: string): number;
}
```

### 3. Output Formats

**XML Format (default)**:
```xml
<context query="user query" files="3" tokens="~2500">
  <file path="src/lib/store.ts" lines="45-95">
    // file content here
  </file>
  <file path="src/commands/search.ts" lines="100-150">
    // file content here
  </file>
</context>
```

**Markdown Format**:
```markdown
# Context for: user query
Files: 3 | Tokens: ~2500

## src/lib/store.ts (lines 45-95)
\`\`\`typescript
// file content here
\`\`\`

## src/commands/search.ts (lines 100-150)
\`\`\`typescript
// file content here
\`\`\`
```

**Plain Format**:
```
=== src/lib/store.ts:45-95 ===
// file content here

=== src/commands/search.ts:100-150 ===
// file content here
```

### 4. Token Estimation
- Use heuristic: 1 token ≈ 4 characters (English text average)
- Add 10% overhead for XML/Markdown formatting
- Track running total during formatting

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] ContextFormatter class created with all 3 format methods
- [ ] Token estimation accurate within 20% of actual
- [ ] Handles empty results gracefully
- [ ] Handles very large results (100+ chunks) efficiently
- [ ] Exports available from `src/lib/formatters/index.ts`

## Technical Notes
- Reuse `ChunkType` and `SearchResult` types from existing code
- Consider streaming for very large contexts (future enhancement)

## Dependencies
None - this is a foundational task

