- [ ] MCP tool `mgrep-context` registered and discoverable
- [ ] Tool returns formatted context in requested format
- [ ] Metadata includes file count, token estimate, truncation status
- [ ] Tool marked as readOnly for auto-approval
- [ ] Works with Claude Desktop and other MCP clients

